Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libwayland-client0 (>= 1.20.0), libvulkan1 (>= 1.3), libasound2 (>= 1.2.0)
Suggests: nvidia-driver | mesa-vulkan-drivers
Homepage: https://github.com/0x07dc/AirplaneGame
Description: High-performance low-poly 3D dogfighting simulator
 Airplane Combat Simulator is a tactical 3D flight combat simulator and aerial
 dogfighting engine engineered in pure Zig with Vulkan 1.3 hardware acceleration,
 native Wayland client windowing, and real-time ALSA audio synthesis.
 .
 Features include a spherical planet with 22 procedural metropolises, naval
 aircraft carrier operations with arrestor gear, automated master server matchmaking,
 60 Hz non-blocking UDP multiplayer with Hermite client interpolation, and
 an avionics HUD with pitch ladder, CCIP bombs, and Sidewinder missiles.
